<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 10.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 10.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 10		April 9</p>
<p>Fed acct			 5.680		  3.446</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	   5.093		 10.501</p>
<p>Cash balance		  10.772		 13.947</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,292.981	     5,294.352</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $153 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
